{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟正在調整Windows 11的軟件開發策略，希望藉助人工智能降低原生Windows應用的開發門檻，讓開發者更容易製作性能更好、界面更貼合系統設計的桌面軟件。隨着越來越多的應用採用Electron、WebView2等技術，將網頁內容封裝成桌面程序，Windows平台上出現了不少內存佔用高、啓動緩慢、系統集成能力有限的應用。微軟如今希望通過原生開發工具與AI編程助手，扭轉這一趨勢。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583460.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:59:39.660979+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:50:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:57:55.887816+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:57:55.887816+00:00","content_hash":"09fa6ae9dfcc31faa00b05f7bfcd8792db8940f848b23e6b84abfe3a0029d7d7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}